{"identifier":"FromtheG1954","title":"From the Ground Up","description":"Promotional film for \"Nutrilite,\" a 1950s-vintage food supplement.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/FromtheG1954/FromtheG1954_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/FromtheG1954","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/FromtheG1954","durationMs":1135000,"level":"C2","topic":"Agriculture: Food industry: Supplements;Nutrition","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — From the Ground Up","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":0,"endMs":1001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":30000,"endMs":38000,"text":"More and more often these days and interesting story is being presented to men and women in homes and offices all over America."},{"startMs":40001,"endMs":52000,"text":"Through a booklet facts about vitamins minerals and neutral light food supplement and the person who presents the story is a"},{"startMs":52000,"endMs":55000,"text":"member of your own community your neutral light distributor."},{"startMs":56000,"endMs":61000,"text":"The factual story has its beginning in one of the loveliest spots in America."},{"startMs":63000,"endMs":69000,"text":"Approximately one hundred miles east of the city of Long Beach California or some of America's most beautiful valleys."},{"startMs":70001,"endMs":77001,"text":"Here the tall majestic peaks of the San Jacinto Mountains tower above one of the richest valleys in the entire West."},{"startMs":78000,"endMs":87001,"text":"Acre after acre of apricots and peaches adorn the valley like living jewels and here is the rich and hearty green of alfalfa."},{"startMs":89000,"endMs":99000,"text":"Many years ago farmers in this beautiful area found that the soil and climate were ideal for raising the finest alfalfa and only the finest will do here"},{"startMs":99000,"endMs":104001,"text":"because this is part of one of the famous neutral light products alfalfa farms."},{"startMs":105001,"endMs":111001,"text":"But it is interesting to see what steps are taken to ensure such a high quality alfalfa."},{"startMs":113000,"endMs":119000,"text":"A very important step is the preparation of a high grade compost to use on the soil."},{"startMs":120000,"endMs":129001,"text":"This machine is called a fox chopper after the top alfalfa has been cut for dehydration this machine cuts a further portion of the stock this to"},{"startMs":129001,"endMs":131000,"text":"be used as part of the compost."},{"startMs":138001,"endMs":148001,"text":"Raw materials used in the compost include in addition to the alfalfa cuttings animal manures, limestone rock, phosphate rock, red rock"},{"startMs":148001,"endMs":150000,"text":"and other mineral compounds."},{"startMs":155001,"endMs":164001,"text":"When the proper ingredients for a compost pile have been assembled they are loaded by this power lift into a specially constructed mixer."},{"startMs":166000,"endMs":171001,"text":"As the materials are spread they are thoroughly mixed to ensure the most uniform decomposition."},{"startMs":173000,"endMs":179000,"text":"After several weeks when the compost has gone through a period of desired decomposition it is turned."},{"startMs":180000,"endMs":190000,"text":"Again the natural bacteria found in the various materials start the necessary decomposition and in several more weeks these piles of compost are ready for use."},{"startMs":191000,"endMs":194001,"text":"During these processes the compost is kept moist at all times."},{"startMs":199001,"endMs":206001,"text":"When the compost is ready for use it is deposited in liberal amounts on the alfalfa fields."},{"startMs":209001,"endMs":214001,"text":"The compost is used in conjunction with hybrid earthworms cultivated at the neutralite farms."},{"startMs":215001,"endMs":220000,"text":"The earthworms aerate the soil and help to work the compost into the ground."},{"startMs":221000,"endMs":231000,"text":"The effectiveness of the compost as a fertilizer is shown by the quality and size of the fruit and flowers at the neutralite farms which have been grown with"},{"startMs":231000,"endMs":232001,"text":"this specially prepared mixture."},{"startMs":234001,"endMs":244000,"text":"After being cut and thoroughly composted the fields are irrigated by overhead sprinklers and each field is thoroughly watered twice between cuttings."},{"startMs":245000,"endMs":252000,"text":"Good soil, special compost, proper irrigation, sunshine and fresh air produce"},{"startMs":252000,"endMs":255000,"text":"this top grade alfalfa now ready for dehydration."},{"startMs":258001,"endMs":267001,"text":"When cutting for dehydration neutralite products takes only the upper few inches of the plant. The remainder is then cut for the compost piles."},{"startMs":269000,"endMs":274001,"text":"As the alfalfa is harvested it is carried up by the conveyor belt and dropped into a wagon."},{"startMs":275001,"endMs":284000,"text":"Thus the alfalfa is cut, gathered and loaded in one operation without touching the ground and is quickly taken from the field to the dehydration area."},{"startMs":285001,"endMs":290001,"text":"The process of dehydration is an interesting one. Let's follow it."},{"startMs":291000,"endMs":299000,"text":"The fresh alfalfa is put into this chopper and is cut into pieces small enough to ensure quick, easy and efficient dehydration."},{"startMs":301000,"endMs":309001,"text":"The chopped alfalfa is then carried mechanically to this tray loader which spreads the alfalfa on trays evenly and in the right amount."},{"startMs":310001,"endMs":317000,"text":"Workmen then load the trays into a drying rack and check to make sure the trays are properly loaded for dehydration."},{"startMs":318001,"endMs":328000,"text":"As the racks of fresh alfalfa are put into the dehydrator, racks of alfalfa which have been dehydrated under rigidly controlled temperature are removed."},{"startMs":330000,"endMs":335001,"text":"When the dehydrated alfalfa is removed from the dehydrator it is emptied into a large hopper."},{"startMs":336001,"endMs":343000,"text":"It then goes through the hammer mill to bring it to a flour-like fineness and is poured from the hoppers into barrels."},{"startMs":343001,"endMs":350000,"text":"The select watercress and parsley which are contained in neutralite food supplement are processed here in the same manner."},{"startMs":352000,"endMs":359001,"text":"When a barrel is full it is weighed and the weight recorded and at the same time the container is flushed with a harmless inert gas."},{"startMs":360001,"endMs":369001,"text":"The barrel is then sealed. The purpose of the inert gas is to displace air which has an oxidizing effect on the alfalfa, watercress and parsley meal."},{"startMs":373000,"endMs":379000,"text":"The number put on this barrel is one of the steps of constant control, quality control."},{"startMs":380000,"endMs":387001,"text":"This is but one of the accurate records, kept even long after the finished product has been eaten, possibly at some far distant point."},{"startMs":390001,"endMs":396001,"text":"The alfalfa, watercress and parsley meal is now ready for the next phase in the long neutralite process."},{"startMs":397000,"endMs":402000,"text":"Sealed, numbered and recorded, the containers are sent by truck to the processing plant."},{"startMs":404001,"endMs":409001,"text":"Buena Park, California is a thriving community some 20 miles northeast of Long Beach."},{"startMs":411000,"endMs":414001,"text":"Here in Buena Park is the home of Neutralite Products Incorporated."},{"startMs":416000,"endMs":418001,"text":"The neutralite plant is large and modern."},{"startMs":419000,"endMs":427001,"text":"The scope of activity here is indicated by the amount of space required so that many phases of the neutralite operation may be performed within the"},{"startMs":427001,"endMs":429001,"text":"confines of this one area."},{"startMs":432001,"endMs":441000,"text":"The size of this storage building gives us an idea of the activities of the entire plant."},{"startMs":441001,"endMs":451000,"text":"Materials used in compounding neutralite are stored here until the neutralite control laboratory has checked and approved their quality and potency to ensure"},{"startMs":451000,"endMs":454000,"text":"that they meet the high standards set by neutralite products."},{"startMs":456001,"endMs":460001,"text":"This building is the extraction laboratory."},{"startMs":461001,"endMs":470000,"text":"Only Carl Renborg and his immediate assistants are admitted to this building, for these exclusive extraction processes are a closely guarded secret."},{"startMs":471000,"endMs":474001,"text":"Here is produced the exclusive neutralite concentrate."},{"startMs":475001,"endMs":484001,"text":"This is a concentrate chemically and mechanically extracted from alfalfa, watercress, parsley and yeast and is found only in neutralite food supplement."},{"startMs":487001,"endMs":492000,"text":"You should meet Carl Renborg. He is the man who developed neutralite food supplement."},{"startMs":493000,"endMs":496001,"text":"He has devoted many years to study and work in the field of nutrition."},{"startMs":497001,"endMs":507000,"text":"The neutralite concentrate, processed by methods known only to neutralite and obtainable only in neutralite products, was developed by Mr. Renborg."},{"startMs":510000,"endMs":521000,"text":"This is where the neutralite capsule compound composed of the neutralite concentrate and added crystalline vitamins and vitamin concentrates is mixed."},{"startMs":521001,"endMs":526000,"text":"All possible care is taken to ensure the highest quality finished product."},{"startMs":528001,"endMs":535001,"text":"The neutralite concentrate is placed in the mixer, together with the added crystalline vitamins and vitamin concentrates in proper proportion."},{"startMs":541000,"endMs":549000,"text":"A harmless inert gas is introduced into the mixture to prevent oxidation."},{"startMs":549000,"endMs":554001,"text":"After thorough mixing and blending, the neutralite compound is ready for encapsulating."},{"startMs":557000,"endMs":561000,"text":"The encapsulating process takes place here."},{"startMs":595000,"endMs":599001,"text":"This machine places empty capsules into a circular metal disk."},{"startMs":612001,"endMs":621000,"text":"The capsules are automatically uncapped. The machine then fills the lower part of the capsule with the neutralite compound, which has been"},{"startMs":621000,"endMs":622001,"text":"fed into a hopper on the machine."},{"startMs":625000,"endMs":631000,"text":"The disk is weighed and the weight and the batch number recorded by the operator."},{"startMs":632000,"endMs":636001,"text":"Thus we see another step in the rigid control exercised by neutralite products."},{"startMs":639000,"endMs":646000,"text":"The filled disk is now returned to the machine for capping of the capsule, and the finished capsules are ready for packaging."},{"startMs":648000,"endMs":658000,"text":"Several times during the processing of each batch, samplings are made, and an extremely sensitive and delicate scale is used to ensure the correct weight for"},{"startMs":658000,"endMs":663000,"text":"every batch of material processed, thus more rigid control."},{"startMs":664000,"endMs":671000,"text":"Samples also go to the quality control laboratory for analysis, to make certain that the neutralite rigid standards are maintained."},{"startMs":673000,"endMs":682001,"text":"Processing of the minerals is also done with great care. The minerals derived from alfalfa, watercress, and parsley by neutralite processes, and the added"},{"startMs":682001,"endMs":689001,"text":"minerals used in neutralite food supplement, are here carefully weighed and measured. Another step in the rigid control."},{"startMs":694001,"endMs":698001,"text":"All the mineral ingredients are placed in this machine and thoroughly mixed."},{"startMs":725001,"endMs":735000,"text":"To ensure proper consistency, the mixture is spread on trays and placed in a drying room. Following the drying process, the mixture is placed in an"},{"startMs":735000,"endMs":740000,"text":"oscillator, which sifts the material into a fine granular form ready for tableting."},{"startMs":740001,"endMs":749000,"text":"The mineral mixture is fed into a hopper in the tableting machine, and is drawn down onto a revolving plate, which contains indentations,"},{"startMs":749000,"endMs":751000,"text":"each of which is filled automatically."},{"startMs":753000,"endMs":760001,"text":"Two sets of plungers work together to compress the mixture into tablet form under several tons of pressure for squaring."},{"startMs":763000,"endMs":773000,"text":"And here again is further evidence of neutralite's constant control. Throughout this stage of the operation, the tablets are sampled frequently and weighed on"},{"startMs":773000,"endMs":774001,"text":"these very delicate scales."},{"startMs":775000,"endMs":784000,"text":"The weight and batch number are recorded, and samples also go to the quality control laboratory for analysis to assure that the high standards are maintained."},{"startMs":786000,"endMs":794000,"text":"When it has been determined that the mineral tablets and the vitamin capsules have met the rigid neutralite requirements, both are brought to this room for packaging."},{"startMs":796001,"endMs":807000,"text":"The filled capsules are emptied into hoppers, from which they are drawn by slotted trays into bottles. Thus the count is automatic. This operation also"},{"startMs":807000,"endMs":808001,"text":"permits a last visual inspection."},{"startMs":818000,"endMs":825001,"text":"As the filled bottles move along the line, a special machine stuffs cotton into each bottle to ensure a firm package."},{"startMs":828000,"endMs":836000,"text":"To guard against oxidation, this machine draws off the air and forces a harmless inert gas into each bottle."},{"startMs":837001,"endMs":846000,"text":"The bottles are then sealed airtight automatically by a machine that firmly affixes the screw cap. The bottles are now ready for labeling."},{"startMs":866001,"endMs":873001,"text":"Here the final operation takes place. Labels are affixed to the bottles mechanically, and the bottles are now ready for packaging."},{"startMs":883001,"endMs":891001,"text":"The mineral tablets are emptied into a hopper, and then are fed into automatic counters. The counter releases the tablets into cellophane"},{"startMs":891001,"endMs":894000,"text":"bags, which are then placed in boxes."},{"startMs":908000,"endMs":911000,"text":"A last visual inspection is made here also."},{"startMs":933000,"endMs":941000,"text":"The bottle of capsules and the box of tablets are packed into one box, and once again we notice that each is identified with its bank."},{"startMs":941001,"endMs":950000,"text":"The package is then sealed in cellophane, packed one dozen to a carton, and the operation at the NutriLite product plant is complete."},{"startMs":953001,"endMs":962000,"text":"From the time the barreled alfalfa, watercress, and parsley meal left the NutriLite product's farms, through the extracting, adding of minerals,"},{"startMs":962000,"endMs":971001,"text":"crystalline vitamins, and vitamin concentrates, measuring, boxing, and weighing, a constant check has been made, and a constant control maintained."},{"startMs":973000,"endMs":978001,"text":"Headquarters for the complete control plan are the NutriLite product's laboratories, also located in Buena Park."},{"startMs":980000,"endMs":984001,"text":"The activity of the NutriLite laboratories is divided into research and control."},{"startMs":985001,"endMs":990000,"text":"The equipment here is some of the most recently developed and most unique in its field."},{"startMs":995000,"endMs":1004000,"text":"The finest and most definitive mineral analysis is ensured by the use of the spectrograph, invaluable in the type of analysis carried on in the laboratory."},{"startMs":1009000,"endMs":1018001,"text":"The NutriLite laboratory is not only evidence of the thoroughness and care which is lavished on the preparation of NutriLite food supplement, but it is a constant"},{"startMs":1018001,"endMs":1027000,"text":"reminder of the unceasing efforts in the direction of further progress in the field of food supplementation made by this highly"},{"startMs":1027000,"endMs":1029000,"text":"competent, carefully trained staff."},{"startMs":1032001,"endMs":1042000,"text":"Let's return now to the NutriLite plant. Here we have seen the preparation of the NutriLite food supplement, the ultimate destination of which is your home."},{"startMs":1044000,"endMs":1048001,"text":"Here in Long Beach, California, are located the offices of Meitinger and Castleberry."},{"startMs":1050000,"endMs":1058001,"text":"Meitinger and Castleberry Incorporated is the exclusive international distributor of NutriLite food supplement. This building and the large, highly trained staff"},{"startMs":1058001,"endMs":1062001,"text":"are needed to meet the tremendous demand for NutriLite food supplement."},{"startMs":1063001,"endMs":1072001,"text":"These young women are handling the correspondence made necessary by the hundreds of thousands of men and women who avail themselves of NutriLite food supplement."},{"startMs":1073000,"endMs":1082001,"text":"And in turn, the entire sales organization was made possible by the founders and chief executives of Meitinger and Castleberry Incorporated, Mr. Lee Meitinger"},{"startMs":1082001,"endMs":1086000,"text":"and Dr. William Castleberry."},{"startMs":1087001,"endMs":1094001,"text":"These two men provide leadership and inspiration to the many thousands of distributors of NutriLite food supplement."},{"startMs":1097000,"endMs":1105000,"text":"So we bring to a close the story of the preparation of NutriLite food supplement from its start in the alfalfa fields of the beautiful Hammett Valley."},{"startMs":1106001,"endMs":1114001,"text":"Through the precise scientific compounding of the NutriLite concentrate and the added crystalline vitamins, vitamin concentrates and minerals"},{"startMs":1114001,"endMs":1116001,"text":"at NutriLite Products Incorporated."},{"startMs":1117001,"endMs":1121001,"text":"Through the unceasing research and analysis at the NutriLite laboratory."},{"startMs":1122001,"endMs":1129001,"text":"Through each step of rigid control, which assures you of the greatest accuracy and the highest quality."},{"startMs":1130000,"endMs":1135000,"text":"NutriLite, truly a distinguished product among food supplements."}]}